  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Standardizing Integrity in Ukraine: Transparency, Professionalism, and Accountability in Justice Sector Reform and Reconstruction</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To contribute to improved and common understanding and interpretation of the integrity and professional ethics criteria across the Judiciary. 2) To contribute to improved and common understanding and interpretation of gender inclusivity and discrimination criteria across the Judiciary. 3) To provide national reconstruction authorities with requisite legal and analytical tools for transparent and accountable management and oversight.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: High Council of Justice, High Qualification Commission of Judges, Ministry of Infrastructure and Development, State Agency for Restoration and Infrastructure Development of Ukraine, judges and members of judicial administration bodies. Indirect beneficiaries: Wider population of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to advance integrity-driven reform and reconstruction of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
